{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2c0a730265c67f1dc8c02040a2032d97.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" width=720 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2c0a730265c67f1dc8c02040a2032d97.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2c0a730265c67f1dc8c02040a2032d97.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Always in Mind is a story-driven action-platforming adventure that takes place where technology and the mind combine.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/ab5201e5516c61504cc189d7f1e0e358.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" width=720 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/ab5201e5516c61504cc189d7f1e0e358.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/ab5201e5516c61504cc189d7f1e0e358.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Paired with a miraculous AI named Proxy, Teddy must master the awe-inspiring powers of his mind in order to escape it, or risk becoming trapped in thought forever.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/46c465cf12eb4125ab4aa0aba494dcba.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" width=720 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/46c465cf12eb4125ab4aa0aba494dcba.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"vi